<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Tapovan Traveller - Yatra Sathi</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f6f1e9;color:#222}
header{background:#17110d;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:18px}header h1{margin:0;font-size:27px}header p{margin:6px 0}
nav{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;background:#fff;padding:8px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10}
nav button,.btn{border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;background:#33261d;color:#fff;font-size:15px}
nav button{background:#f0e6da;color:#222;white-space:nowrap}
.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:14px}.hero,.card{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px #0001}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.card h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:19px}.muted{color:#666}
section{display:none}.active{display:block}
input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;margin:6px 0 10px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:9px;font-size:15px}
label{font-weight:bold;font-size:14px}.green{background:#13833d}.orange{background:#d56a00}.blue{background:#175ea8}.red{background:#a52525}
.item{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0}.item button{margin:5px 4px 0 0}
.preview{max-width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin-top:10px}.notice{background:#fff5c9;padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
@media(max-width:650px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><h1>🛕 Tapovan Traveller</h1><h2 style='margin:4px 0;font-size:21px'>यात्रा साथी • Yatra Sathi</h2><p>यात्रा • तीर्थ • होटल • Traveller • Live Darshan</p></header>
<nav>
<button onclick="show('home')">🏠 Home</button><button onclick="show('bus')">🚌 Traveller</button>
